"sent_id": "t0015.s03"
},
{
"start": 733.32,
"end": 735.48,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Welcome back to the show.",
"char_start": 2611,
"char_end": 2636,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s01"
},
{
"start": 840.0,
"end": 841.14,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to delve into that further.",
"char_start": 2637,
"char_end": 2671,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 841.2,
"end": 844.68,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Which version of the question is truly important?",
"char_start": 2672,
"char_end": 2721,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 844.68,
"end": 847.8,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "I'm giving you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 2740,
"char_end": 2791,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 847.86,
"end": 853.56,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "The speed comes from braking earlier and more gently, not from taking more risks.",
"char_start": 2792,
"char_end": 2873,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 853.62,
"end": 856.62,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 2874,
"char_end": 2917,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 856.68,
"end": 861.0,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone misses.",
"char_start": 2918,
"char_end": 2983,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 861.0,
"end": 863.46,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 3000,
"char_end": 3037,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 863.52,
"end": 868.26,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the operational aspect that most auditors do not have access to?",
"char_start": 3038,
"char_end": 3110,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 868.26,
"end": 875.4,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Yes, so – tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than minor suspension adjustments.",
"char_start": 3129,
"char_end": 3235,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 875.46,
"end": 879.12,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "The setup is important because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 3236,
"char_end": 3311,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 879.12,
"end": 880.86,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 3328,
"char_end": 3355,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 880.92,
"end": 884.4,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Which version of the question is truly important?",
"char_start": 3356,
"char_end": 3405,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 884.4,
"end": 891.9,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Yes, so – risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 3424,
"char_end": 3539,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 891.96,
"end": 894.96,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 3540,
"char_end": 3583,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 895.02,
"end": 898.62,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 3584,
"char_end": 3646,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 898.62,
"end": 900.12,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Tell me more.",
"char_start": 3663,
"char_end": 3676,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 900.12,
"end": 904.38,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is particularly evident.",
"char_start": 3695,
"char_end": 3776,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 904.44,
"end": 909.12,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3777,
"char_end": 3844,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s02"
},
{
"start": 909.12,
"end": 910.2,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3861,
"char_end": 3883,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 910.26,
"end": 913.86,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of enduro racing?",
"char_start": 3884,
"char_end": 3940,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 913.86,
"end": 922.5,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "It boils down to this: the erosion patterns on the special stages change the optimal racing line between the reconnaissance runs and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 3959,
"char_end": 4112,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 922.56,
"end": 926.16,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 4113,
"char_end": 4175,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 1320.0,
"end": 1324.86,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final section to risk management.",
"char_start": 4192,
"char_end": 4275,
"unit_id": "t0026.u01",
"sent_id": "t0026.s01"
},
{
"start": 1324.86,
"end": 1333.32,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "That's where the conversation becomes interesting, because the compromises related to risk management touch upon everything we've discussed.",
"char_start": 4294,
"char_end": 4434,
"unit_id": "t0027.u01",
"sent_id": "t0027.s01"
},
{
"start": 1333.32,
"end": 1335.78,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 4451,
"char_end": 4488,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s01"
},
{
"start": 1335.84,
"end": 1340.82,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the counter-flow angle that most auditors do not have access to?",
"char_start": 4489,
"char_end": 4561,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s02"
},
{
"start": 1340.82,
"end": 1341.36,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 4580,
"char_end": 4590,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s01"
},
{
"start": 1341.42,
"end": 1347.12,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "The increased speed comes from braking earlier and more gently, not from taking more risks.",
"char_start": 4591,
"char_end": 4682,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s02"
},
{
"start": 1347.18,
"end": 1350.18,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 4683,
"char_end": 4726,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s03"
},
{
"start": 1350.24,
"end": 1353.84,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
